    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d503">

                <pb facs="0567" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg551"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.252/5–1947: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in Chile </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-11T19:00:00-04:00">June 11, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>283. Dept surprised coolness Bernstein, Vergara and statement treaty ultimately
                    dependent results Geneva conference ref Embdes 15297 May 19, 1947.<anchor n="82"
                        xml:id="d503-f1"/> Under circumstances considered desirable now above all
                    secure reaffirmation Chilean interest in treaty.</p>
                <p>Unless strongly felt attitude Vergara, Bernstein accurately and fully reflects
                    views FonMin or other serious objection perceived, Emb instructed approach
                    FonMin with view securing reaffirmation even in general terms pointing out not
                    immediately seeking opening formal negotiations.</p>
                <p> Urinfo only Dept feels present inopportune press further for Chilean views
                    specific articles US draft or attempt conduct concrete discussion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d503-f1" n="82" xml:id="d503-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
